**Deviation:** FS-2’s specified restore command cannot extract through B’s dangling `store/archive` symlink on macOS. I added a guarded unlink before tar extraction so the intended 2024 recovery works; the archive still contains only `store/archive/2024.csv`. I have no remaining uncertainty about the tested labels. No packages were installed, no commit was made, and no other project files were edited.
